hird quarter with injury at Florida State","description":"In the regular-season finale for both teams, Florida quarterback Aaron Philo was knocked out of the Gators' contest against the Florida State Seminoles in the third quarter after taking a hard hit following a run, and he was replaced by Tramell Jones Jr.","published":"2026-11-27T23:43:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50616023/injured-florida-quarterback-aaron-philo-exits-3rd-quarter","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Akron coach Joe Moorhead resigns after 5 seasons to pursue other opportunities","description":"Akron head coach Joe Moorhead is stepping down after five seasons with the Zips to pursue other opportunities, he announced Friday.","published":"2026-11-27T21:03:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50614041/akron-coach-joe-moorhead-resigns-pursue-other-opportunities","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the winningest college football coaches of all time?","description":"From Saban to Paterno, there are many legendary college football coaches. Who has the best career record? Check out who has the most wins now.","published":"2026-11-27T20:18:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/39283806/who-winningest-college-football-coaches-all","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Rivalry Week live: Top plays and playoff analysis","description":"It's the final week of the regular season. Here are the best plays, moments and CFP implications.","published":"2026-11-27T20:37:42.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50596213/rivalry-week-live-cfp-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 'College GameDay' Week 13: Duke vs. Wake Forest","description":"\"College GameDay\" heads to Wake Forest University for Week 13.","published":"2026-11-27T17:21:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50612493/2026-college-gameday-week-13-duke-vs-wake-forest","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"How every 2027 five-star college football prospect will fit","description":"There are 23 five-star players in the class, and we scout each one's game for the next level.","published":"2026-11-27T17:00:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/48543549/college-football-recruiting-2027-prospects-five-star-scouts-take","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-27T15:51:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Houston, rivalry color rushes lead top uniforms of CFB Week 13","description":"Just because it's rivalry week doesn't mean teams still can't put their best foot forward with uniform swag.","published":"2026-11-27T15:00:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50598211/college-football-uniforms-week-13-houston","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What the world looked like the last time Texas A&M beat Texas","description":"It has been 15 years since Texas A&M came out on top on the gridiron against its rivals to the southwest.","published":"2026-11-27T17:36:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/47109982/texas-aggies-lone-star-showdown-last-win-2010","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079349/isaac-brown","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isaac_Brown_(American_football)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Isaac Brown (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isaac_Brown_(American_football)","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-26T23:15:22Z","intro":"Isaac Brown (born March 2, 2005) is an American college football running back for the Louisville Cardinals.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Brown attended Homestead Senior High School in Homestead, Florida. He had 650 rushing yards and 10 touchdowns as a junior and 1,084 yards as a senior. He committed to the University of Louisville to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"2024 SEASON\nIn his first game as a true freshman at Louisville, Brown rushed for 123 yards on five carries with a touchdown. He rushed for 1,173 yards, becoming the first true freshman in program history to rush for over 1,000 yards. He led the ACC with 7.1 yards per carry and finished third in rushing yards.\nHe was named ACC Rookie of the Year and ACC Offensive Rookie of the Year. Brown also received second-team All-ACC honors.\n\n2025 SEASON\nBrown entered the 2025 season as the starting running back for the Cardinals."}]}}